months without falling for her...

20:45.860 --> 20:48.890
and prove to you two how 
much I'm in love with you!

20:53.860 --> 20:56.250
You're confident you aren't 
going to fall for her?

20:56.850 --> 20:58.020
I don't know, but...

20:58.020 --> 20:59.480
You aren't?!

21:00.360 --> 21:01.640
I don't know, but...

21:02.440 --> 21:06.250
I'm certain I love you two way more.

21:08.180 --> 21:09.620
Naoya-kun!

21:13.120 --> 21:14.470
Damn it...

21:15.040 --> 21:17.530
All right, fine.

21:17.530 --> 21:19.000
Do what you want.

21:19.000 --> 21:20.710
Sakisaki?!

21:20.710 --> 21:24.860
I mean, once he has his mind set on something,
 there's no talking him out of it.

21:24.860 --> 21:26.140
Still...

21:29.130 --> 21:31.000
Let's at least enjoy camping!

21:31.000 --> 21:32.230
Hey!

21:33.860 --> 21:35.600
The meat's so good!

21:35.920 --> 21:37.560
The river's so cold!

21:37.560 --> 21:39.800
I'm sleepy from the all-nighter.

21:39.800 --> 21:41.570
All right, let's go home!

21:50.150 --> 21:51.160
<i>Mukai-kun...</i>

21:52.850 --> 22:00.170
<i>If I go all-out like Hoshizaki-san and he 
rejects me, I might be able to move on.</i>

22:01.060 --> 22:04.130
<i>And why is Sakisaki so...</i>

22:05.330 --> 22:07.910
<i>I would never go along 
with this if I were her.</i>

22:08.320 --> 22:11.510
<i>I wouldn't want to risk 
letting anyone else take him.</i>

22:20.050 --> 22:26.110
<i>Maybe I'm more serious about 
Mukai-kun than Sakisaki is.</i>

22:27.140 --> 22:31.240
<i>Then maybe I don't need to hold back...</i>

22:32.080 --> 22:37.040
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

22:32.440 --> 22:35.420
We're going to have a talk when you get back.

22:35.420 --> 22:36.620
Sorry...

22:37.040 --> 22:42.040
<b>The Girlfriends' Resignations</b>

24:12.470 --> 24:14.680
Next episode preview, but it's on Risapon TV!

24:14.680 --> 24:17.430
In episode seven, Shino-san's going to 
do sexy things to seduce Onii-chan!

24:17.430 --> 24:20.030
Why am I always so bold 
in the weirdest of ways?!

24:20.030 --> 24:21.400
We see Shino-san get serious!

24:21.400 --> 24:23.720
What's more, Onii-chan's reaction is...

24:23.720 --> 24:24.600
Huh? What happens?

24:24.600 --> 24:25.350
Tell me!

24:25.350 --> 24:27.020
You're so desperate it's scary!
